---
import {
  coupledTransitionModes,
  sampleCouplingScan,
} from '../../../data/part05/ch21LinearResponseModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch21-coupled-transitions';
const width = 780;
const height = 360;
const pad = { left: 64, right: 30, top: 28, bottom: 58 };
const defaults = {
  energy1: 3,
  energy2: 5,
  coupling: 0.6,
  dipole1: 1,
  dipole2: 1,
  minCoupling: -1.5,
  maxCoupling: 1.5,
};
const scan = sampleCouplingScan({
  energy1: defaults.energy1,
  energy2: defaults.energy2,
  dipole1: defaults.dipole1,
  dipole2: defaults.dipole2,
  minCoupling: defaults.minCoupling,
  maxCoupling: defaults.maxCoupling,
  points: 181,
});
const current = coupledTransitionModes(defaults);
const energyMin = Math.min(...scan.map((point) => point.lower.energy)) - 0.25;
const energyMax = Math.max(...scan.map((point) => point.upper.energy)) + 0.25;
const xScale = (coupling) => pad.left
  + (coupling - defaults.minCoupling) / (defaults.maxCoupling - defaults.minCoupling)
    * (width - pad.left - pad.right);
const yScale = (energy) => pad.top
  + (energyMax - energy) / (energyMax - energyMin) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom);
const lowerPoints = scan
  .map((point) => `${xScale(point.coupling).toFixed(2)},${yScale(point.lower.energy).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');
const upperPoints = scan
  .map((point) => `${xScale(point.coupling).toFixed(2)},${yScale(point.upper.energy).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');
const markerRadius = (strength) => 4 + 6 * Math.sqrt(strength / Math.max(current.outputStrength, 1e-12));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual coupled-transition" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>跃迁耦合与振子强度重分配 | Transition coupling and oscillator-strength redistribution</strong>
    <span>原创 Tamm–Dancoff 型二跃迁模型：kernel 耦合改变集体本征模并在 bright/dark 组合之间重新分配谱权。</span>
    <span lang="en">Original two-transition Tamm–Dancoff-like model: kernel coupling changes the collective eigenmodes and redistributes spectral weight between bright and dark combinations.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      第二跃迁能量 Δ₂
      <input data-energy2 type="range" min="3.2" max="7" step="0.1" value={defaults.energy2} />
    </label>
    <label>
      kernel 耦合 K₁₂
      <input data-coupling type="range" min={defaults.minCoupling} max={defaults.maxCoupling} step="0.05" value={defaults.coupling} />
    </label>
    <label>
      第二跃迁偶极 d₂
      <input data-dipole2 type="range" min="-1.5" max="1.5" step="0.05" value={defaults.dipole2} />
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>二跃迁响应矩阵的本征能量和谱权</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>横轴为跃迁间 kernel 耦合。两条曲线是低能和高能集体模式，当前耦合处圆点大小表示各模式的偶极强度。</desc>
    <line class="axis" x1={pad.left} y1={height - pad.bottom} x2={width - pad.right} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="axis" x1={pad.left} y1={pad.top} x2={pad.left} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <polyline class="mode-curve mode-curve--lower" data-lower points={lowerPoints} />
    <polyline class="mode-curve mode-curve--upper" data-upper points={upperPoints} />
    <line class="selection-line" data-selection x1={xScale(defaults.coupling)} x2={xScale(defaults.coupling)} y1={pad.top} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <circle class="mode-marker mode-marker--lower" data-lower-marker cx={xScale(defaults.coupling)} cy={yScale(current.lower.energy)} r={markerRadius(current.lower.strength)} />
    <circle class="mode-marker mode-marker--upper" data-upper-marker cx={xScale(defaults.coupling)} cy={yScale(current.upper.energy)} r={markerRadius(current.upper.strength)} />
    <text x={pad.left} y={height - 25} text-anchor="middle">−1.5</text>
    <text x={width - pad.right} y={height - 25} text-anchor="middle">1.5</text>
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 7} text-anchor="middle">kernel coupling K₁₂</text>
    <text transform={`translate(18 ${(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2}) rotate(-90)`} text-anchor="middle">mode energy</text>
    <text class="curve-label" x={width - 170} y={pad.top + 24}>upper mode</text>
    <text class="curve-label" x={width - 170} y={height - pad.bottom - 18}>lower mode</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>Δ₁ = {defaults.energy1.toFixed(1)}</span>
    <span>Δ₂ = <output data-energy2-output>{defaults.energy2.toFixed(1)}</output></span>
    <span>K₁₂ = <output data-coupling-output>{defaults.coupling.toFixed(2)}</output></span>
    <span>Ω₋ = <output data-lower-energy>{current.lower.energy.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
    <span>Ω₊ = <output data-upper-energy>{current.upper.energy.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
    <span>F₋ = <output data-lower-strength>{current.lower.strength.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
    <span>F₊ = <output data-upper-strength>{current.upper.strength.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
    <span>F total = <output data-total-strength>{current.outputStrength.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>$H_{\mathrm{tr}}=\begin{pmatrix}\Delta_1&K_{12}\\K_{12}&\Delta_2\end{pmatrix}$；正交本征向量旋转输入偶极向量 $(d_1,d_2)$。这是有限 Tamm–Dancoff 型模型，不是完整 Casida/BSE 求解器。</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>本征值等于解析二阶矩阵结果；非零耦合产生 level repulsion；正交旋转严格保持 $F_-+F_+=d_1^2+d_2^2$；当 $\Delta_1=\Delta_2$ 且 $d_1=d_2$ 时，一个组合变暗、另一个增强。</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>模型没有反共振块、频率依赖 kernel、连续谱、非 Hermitian lifetime、真实轨道积分或 $k$ 点。谱权重重分配不能被解释为任何具体材料的预测。</p>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript fallback | No-JavaScript fallback：</strong>默认 Δ₁=3、Δ₂=5、K₁₂=0.6、d₁=d₂=1 的两条模式曲线、当前能量和谱权仍可见；控件不更新。</p>
  </noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    coupledTransitionModes,
    sampleCouplingScan,
  } from '../../../data/part05/ch21LinearResponseModels.mjs';

  const root = document.getElementById('ch21-coupled-transitions');
  if (root) {
    const energy2Input = root.querySelector('[data-energy2]');
    const couplingInput = root.querySelector('[data-coupling]');
    const dipole2Input = root.querySelector('[data-dipole2]');
    const lowerCurve = root.querySelector('[data-lower]');
    const upperCurve = root.querySelector('[data-upper]');
    const selectionLine = root.querySelector('[data-selection]');
    const lowerMarker = root.querySelector('[data-lower-marker]');
    const upperMarker = root.querySelector('[data-upper-marker]');
    const energy2Output = root.querySelector('[data-energy2-output]');
    const couplingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-coupling-output]');
    const lowerEnergyOutput = root.querySelector('[data-lower-energy]');
    const upperEnergyOutput = root.querySelector('[data-upper-energy]');
    const lowerStrengthOutput = root.querySelector('[data-lower-strength]');
    const upperStrengthOutput = root.querySelector('[data-upper-strength]');
    const totalStrengthOutput = root.querySelector('[data-total-strength]');

    if (
      energy2Input instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && couplingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && dipole2Input instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && lowerCurve instanceof SVGPolylineElement
      && upperCurve instanceof SVGPolylineElement
      && selectionLine instanceof SVGLineElement
      && lowerMarker instanceof SVGCircleElement
      && upperMarker instanceof SVGCircleElement
      && energy2Output instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && couplingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && lowerEnergyOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && upperEnergyOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && lowerStrengthOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && upperStrengthOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && totalStrengthOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
    ) {
      const width = 780;
      const height = 360;
      const pad = { left: 64, right: 30, top: 28, bottom: 58 };
      const energy1 = 3;
      const dipole1 = 1;
      const minCoupling = -1.5;
      const maxCoupling = 1.5;
      const xScale = (coupling) => pad.left
        + (coupling - minCoupling) / (maxCoupling - minCoupling)
          * (width - pad.left - pad.right);

      const update = () => {
        const energy2 = Number(energy2Input.value);
        const coupling = Number(couplingInput.value);
        const dipole2 = Number(dipole2Input.value);
        const scan = sampleCouplingScan({
          energy1,
          energy2,
          dipole1,
          dipole2,
          minCoupling,
          maxCoupling,
          points: 181,
        });
        const current = coupledTransitionModes({
          energy1,
          energy2,
          coupling,
          dipole1,
          dipole2,
        });
        const energyMin = Math.min(...scan.map((point) => point.lower.energy)) - 0.25;
        const energyMax = Math.max(...scan.map((point) => point.upper.energy)) + 0.25;
        const yScale = (energy) => pad.top
          + (energyMax - energy) / (energyMax - energyMin) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom);
        const x = xScale(coupling);
        const radius = (strength) => 4
          + 6 * Math.sqrt(strength / Math.max(current.outputStrength, 1e-12));

        lowerCurve.setAttribute('points', scan
          .map((point) => `${xScale(point.coupling).toFixed(2)},${yScale(point.lower.energy).toFixed(2)}`)
          .join(' '));
        upperCurve.setAttribute('points', scan
          .map((point) => `${xScale(point.coupling).toFixed(2)},${yScale(point.upper.energy).toFixed(2)}`)
          .join(' '));
        selectionLine.setAttribute('x1', String(x));
        selectionLine.setAttribute('x2', String(x));
        lowerMarker.setAttribute('cx', String(x));
        lowerMarker.setAttribute('cy', String(yScale(current.lower.energy)));
        lowerMarker.setAttribute('r', String(radius(current.lower.strength)));
        upperMarker.setAttribute('cx', String(x));
        upperMarker.setAttribute('cy', String(yScale(current.upper.energy)));
        upperMarker.setAttribute('r', String(radius(current.upper.strength)));
        energy2Output.value = energy2.toFixed(1);
        couplingOutput.value = coupling.toFixed(2);
        lowerEnergyOutput.value = current.lower.energy.toFixed(3);
        upperEnergyOutput.value = current.upper.energy.toFixed(3);
        lowerStrengthOutput.value = current.lower.strength.toFixed(3);
        upperStrengthOutput.value = current.upper.strength.toFixed(3);
        totalStrengthOutput.value = current.outputStrength.toFixed(3);
      };

      energy2Input.addEventListener('input', update);
      couplingInput.addEventListener('input', update);
      dipole2Input.addEventListener('input', update);
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .coupled-transition {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-inline: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .coupled-transition svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 36rem;
    height: auto;
  }

  .axis {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }

  .mode-curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .mode-curve--lower {
    stroke: currentColor;
  }

  .mode-curve--upper {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .selection-line {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 4;
  }

  .mode-marker {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .mode-marker--lower {
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .mode-marker--upper {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .curve-label {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
